            <title>0.27.10</title>
            <pubDate>Thu, 29 Oct 2026 20:03:56 -0400</pubDate>
            <sparkle:version>70</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>0.27.10</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <description><![CDATA[<style>:root{color-scheme:light dark}body{font:13px/1.45 -apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,system-ui,sans-serif;color:#1d1d1f;margin:0;padding:2px 4px}h3{font-size:13px;font-weight:600;margin:0 0 6px}ul{margin:0;padding-left:18px}li{margin:0 0 4px}code{font:12px ui-monospace,Menlo,monospace}@media (prefers-color-scheme: dark){body{color:#f5f5f7}}</style><h3>What's new in Keeploop 0.27.10</h3><ul><li>Texts you send now show when they were delivered and read: get_conversation and search_messages give delivered_at and read_at on your own messages (read_at only when the other person shares read receipts). send_message returns the message's guid, and get_conversation(guid=...) checks just that message.</li></ul>]]></description>
